SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ssiiggffaassttbblloocckk function is non-standard, although a similar functional‐
     ity is a common optimization provided by several other systems.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ssiiggffaassttbblloocckk function was introduced in FreeBSD 13.0.

BBUUGGSS
     The ssiiggffaassttbblloocckk symbol is currently not exported by libc, on purpose.
     Consumers should either use the __sys_fast_sigblock symbol from the pri‐
     vate libc namespace, or utilize syscall(2).

